  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "10.16.1.0: RevenueCat Android SDK updated from 10.1.2 to 10.16.1. Notable upstream core-SDK changes: BillingClient connection moved off the main thread, showInAppMessages guarded against BillingClient runtime crashes, several OutOfMemory fixes around cached offerings/ETag responses, interface default methods made usable from Java in all published modules, unified StoreReplacementMode API. Full changelog: https://github.com/RevenueCat/purchases-android/releases. POM dependency list is unchanged from 10.1.2. 10.1.2.2: the RevenueCat AAR is now consumed via AndroidMavenLibrary (fetched from Maven Central when the binding itself is built) with POM-driven Java dependency verification, and the committed Jars were removed - shipped binaries are byte-identical to 10.1.2.1, nothing changes for consumers.",
